# Coati Scavenger {2}{G} (3/2): "Descend 4 - When this creature enters, if there are four or more permanent cards in your graveyard,
# return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand" (CR 207.2c, 603.4, 110.4a, 115.1). Bot1 mills four Plains with two
# Thought Scours (the Scours, instants, sit in the graveyard too but are no permanent cards): exactly four. Coati is paid exactly
# (Emerald, Jet and Ruby). Bot2's Ornithopter, discarded to hand size, is a permanent card in the wrong graveyard (refused, and it
# stays there), the Scour an instant card in the right one (refused); a Plains is accepted and returns to Bot1's hand.

